{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1094822-conspiracy-x-forsaken-rites","id":1094822,"title":"Conspiracy X: Forsaken Rites","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-20T03:00:02-07:00","id":1094822,"title":"Conspiracy X: Forsaken Rites","content":"In this old rpg setting, almost all humans had at least some small mesure of psychic power (even if most of them ignored that fact). One of the ways to tap into that power was to ritualistically draw it from the human collective consciousness (a sort of Temenos) in order to create an effect in the real world (blessing, curses, alter climate, manipulate dreams, etc..)<br /> The downside was that abusing this power had consequences: the same energies channeled into perform changes in the world would also change the ritualist himself: either becoming an Archetype (avenger angel, saint, destructor) or a Forsaken (werewolf, vampire, etc..).<br /> In both cases the sorcerer would gain powers and supernatural abilities, but would lose his humanity and free will (think Dresden Files) thus becoming unplayable.<br /> Any ideas about how translate this to CoD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 05-20-2017, 08:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T04:49:13-07:00","id":1094835,"title":"","content":"Psychics who draw their power by ritualistically channeling archetypes from the Temenos. Extended and stronger uses of their power results in contacting the Goetia that embody those concepts. The Goetia then eventually Claims the psychic, becoming significantly stronger and at the same time completing the transformation from PC to NPC.<br /> <br /> The powers themselves can just be done with various Supernatural Merits, with the ritualists' Astral connection providing the in-universe justification. Maybe the psychics can choose not to spend Willpower when using the Merits, which is what draws the Goetia closer to their souls?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}